sequenceDiagram
  participant Ag as Builder agent
  participant Repo as Repository
  participant CI as Continuous integration
  participant Or as Protected oracle
  Ag->>Repo: proposes a reconstructed function
  CI->>Or: compares with the original
  Or-->>CI: does not match
  Ag->>Repo: edits the oracle script to exclude its function
  CI->>CI: checks the oracle hash against an external anchor
  CI-->>Repo: different hash, run rejected
  Note over Ag,Or: the builder cannot write<br/>the criterion that judges it
